 ## Background
-The method was introduced in a 2011 short paper by the authors of "Two Simple Single-pass GPU methods for Multi-channel Surface Voxelization of Dynamic Scenes" [S1, unofficial]. It was integrated into a real-time deferred renderer using OpenGL and GLSL [S1, unofficial]. The work compares favorably to earlier methods by Fang et al. [FC00] and Eisemann et al. [ED06], offering a balance between speed and data richness [S1, unofficial].
